|> Exercise
    work=ing
    handle=_draw_the_sandwich_

    Illustrate the “Gregorinovich sandwich”
    with a picture that actually looks like
    a sandwich. 

    |> Solution

        The sandwich, which states that

        $$
        \sin\theta < \theta < \tan\theta
        $$

        |> ImageRight
            src=tmp-images/e5_greg_sandwich_tant_cloud.svg
            offset_x=4em

        for $0 < \theta < \eta$, is hereby illustrated, using
        the fact that 
        $\theta$ 
        !! can be identified with 
        equals subtended
        arc length on the unit circle:

        |> Image
            src=tmp-images/e5_greg_sandwich.svg

        |> StarDivider